WEBVTT

00:01:58.685 --> 00:02:01.386
she's old enough to have sex with.

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:04.369
This baseball model
is incredibly problematic.

00:02:04.393 --> 00:02:06.720
It's sexist. It's heterosexist.

00:02:06.744 --> 00:02:09.096
It's competitive. It's goal-directed.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.879
And it can't result in healthy sexuality

00:02:11.903 --> 00:02:14.927
developing in young people or in adults.

00:02:14.951 --> 00:02:16.649
So we need a new model.

00:02:16.673 --> 00:02:19.208
I'm here today to offer
you that new model.

00:02:19.232 --> 00:02:20.983
And it's based on

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:22.809
pizza.

00:02:22.833 --> 00:02:26.256
Now pizza is something
that is universally understood

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:29.153
and that most people associate
with a positive experience.

00:02:29.177 --> 00:02:30.133
So let's do this.